ind":"announcement","title":"Audiospeed launches in Early Access on November 11, 2026","summary":"It's official: Audiospeed launches in Early Access on November 11, 2026. If you've already tried the demo, thank you. You've been our first test pilots. On launch day the full tournament opens up, all the way to the Hydra system. Help us tune the race Early Access is where we fine-tune Audiospeed with you, so here are the questions we'll keep asking: Does each difficulty level feel fair, or does one jump too far ahead of the others? Which starship do you never pick, and why? Is there a moment on","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T12:43:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706681329","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3669730-1844751498218088","game_id":"steam-3669730","kind":"announcement","title":"Eleven languages, and a new way to beat your sighted friends","summary":"The demo on Steam has been updated, and it is a big one.ELEVEN LANGUAGESWe started with three. AUDIOSPEED now speaks Italian, English, Spanish, French, German, Arabic, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Japanese, Russian and Hindi. And not just the menus: interface, full voice-over, subtitles, the navigator calling your corners, the crowd telling you how badly it went. All of it, in every one of them, with a native voice for each. It still guesses your language on the first launch.AUDIO VS. VIDEO MULTI","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T11:02:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498218088","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3669730":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:41:08Z","status":"ok","all_so